SUMMARY:Inner Child Playshop
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nYou're invited to the best play date of the year.\
 nWho's inviting you? Your inner child. And they want you to know\; it's be
 en too long since the two of you spent time together doing things that bri
 ng you joy and wonder.\n\nSenseful Wellness is pairing up with Ayla Claypo
 ol for an afternoon that is equal parts intentional and delightfully unser
 ious. A three-hour hang designed for the part of you that still knows how 
 to play.\nAyla will guide everyone through a series of games using techniq
 ues from physical theatre theorist Jacques Lecoq in order to open our spac
 ial and emotional awareness and take steps toward transformation. Explorat
 ory and silly\, serious play asks everyone the question of what does it me
 an to move like a kid again. To find the joy.\n\nVi will open and close th
 e Playshop calling in your inner child and creating the container for them
  to actually show up and stay a while.\n\nJenn will move everyone through 
 an Inner Child Vinyasa Flow\, designed for all bodies and all ages.\nToget
 her we have created an afternoon that gives your inner child permission to
  flourish\, and reminds everyone that we are all still big kids at heart.\
 n\nCome play with us.
